                <invention-title lang="de">ELEKTRONISCHE VORRICHTUNG MIT BIOMETRISCHEM SENSOR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF ÉLECTRONIQUE COMPRENANT UN CAPTEUR BIOMÉTRIQUE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ELECTRONIC DEVICE INCLUDING BIOMETRIC SENSOR</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electronic device is provided. The electronic device includes a transparent member comprising a transparent material, a display panel disposed under the transparent member and including a plurality of pixels, a biometric sensor disposed under the display panel, and a filter disposed between the display panel and the biometric sensor and covering the biometric sensor.</p>
